WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.205 --> 00:00:03.122
(orchestral music)

00:00:06.141 --> 00:00:07.302
(sneezing)

00:00:07.302 --> 00:00:08.425
- There she goes again.

00:00:08.425 --> 00:00:09.304
- Did she just bark?

00:00:09.304 --> 00:00:10.912
- Yeah, she's been doing in all week.

00:00:10.912 --> 00:00:12.054
Just out of nowhere.

00:00:12.054 --> 00:00:12.942
- So what do you?

00:00:12.942 --> 00:00:14.176
- Well I bark right back.

00:00:14.176 --> 00:00:17.238
It's like you want to play this
game, I invented this game.

00:00:17.238 --> 00:00:18.617
(sneezing)

00:00:18.617 --> 00:00:20.960
(barking)

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:21.837
(sneezing)

00:00:21.837 --> 00:00:22.670
(barking)

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:23.503
(sneezing)
(barking)

00:00:23.503 --> 00:00:24.479
- Nice, you know what

00:00:24.479 --> 00:00:26.079
I've been doing lately that's really fun?

00:00:26.079 --> 00:00:27.911
- I have about eight years of experience.

00:00:27.911 --> 00:00:30.074
(barking)

00:00:30.074 --> 00:00:31.300
Yes, yes, I actually interned

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:34.099
for a graphic design company in college.

00:00:34.099 --> 00:00:36.487
(barking)

00:00:36.487 --> 00:00:37.913
Yes, yes in college yes.

00:00:37.913 --> 00:00:40.080
(barking)

00:00:41.361 --> 00:00:45.458
And I think I have all
the necessary skills

00:00:45.458 --> 00:00:47.022
(barking)

00:00:47.022 --> 00:00:49.272
to do well in your company.

00:00:50.786 --> 00:00:54.036
Yes, Tuesday would be great, thank you.

00:00:56.629 --> 00:00:58.433
- Sounds like a real win win.

00:00:58.433 --> 00:00:59.610
- How's your love life Molly?

00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:01.081
- Oh, I don't even want to hear about it.

00:01:01.081 --> 00:01:02.153
- Well, I've almost bumped into

00:01:02.153 --> 00:01:04.545
this guy Roger like a couple of times now

00:01:04.545 --> 00:01:06.297
but we keep missing each other.

00:01:06.297 --> 00:01:08.298
(car starting)

00:01:08.298 --> 00:01:11.965
Oh, hey, I'm Molly and
you are walking away.

00:01:13.017 --> 00:01:14.177
I just was to get up close so I

00:01:14.177 --> 00:01:15.575
can get a good sniff or something.

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:16.408
- Food's here.

00:01:16.408 --> 00:01:17.991
- Someone say food?

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:20.382
- Ah, yes!

00:01:20.382 --> 00:01:21.383
- Oh look at this thing!

00:01:21.383 --> 00:01:22.216
- Yeah!

00:01:24.764 --> 00:01:26.855
- Hey Molly, Molly,

00:01:26.855 --> 00:01:29.688
it's me, Roger, from the dog park.

00:01:31.359 --> 00:01:33.859
She doesn't even know I exist.

